* **Visual Studio**

## 🎯 Purpose

These tasks showcase programming knowledge beyond the basics and demonstrate readiness to:

* understand developer codebases
* write automation-friendly logic
* support QA Automation workflows

Part of my Software QA learning journey and portfolio.
